{"title": "Parry", "pageid": 20599, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Parry", "categories": ["Passive features", "Toggleable passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters", "Sources of damage reduction"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki_Parry\" title=\"Githyanki Parry\">Githyanki Parry</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Supreme_Githyanki_Parry\" title=\"Supreme Githyanki Parry\">Supreme Githyanki Parry</a>      </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Parry.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Parry.webp/300px-Parry.webp, /w/images/9/94/Parry.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Parry.webp/300px-Parry.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Parry.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Parry</b> is a toggleable passive feature that lets you automatically reduce the damage of the next melee attack.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Parry the next melee attack that hits you to reduce the damage by 1d8 + <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> Modifier. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><img alt=\"Loading Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Toggleable</span></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ca%C3%AFros\" title=\"Caïros\">Caïros</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Godey\" title=\"Godey\">Godey</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Stalker_Svignee\" title=\"Stalker Svignee\">Stalker Svignee</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/That_Which_Guards\" title=\"That Which Guards\">That Which Guards</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/That_Which_Lurks\" title=\"That Which Lurks\">That Which Lurks</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/That_Which_Watches\" title=\"That Which Watches\">That Which Watches</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203156\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.027 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 579/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2578/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 985/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 15/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 506/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 647973/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   26.776      1 -total\n 96.89%   25.943      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 27.14%    7.266      1 Template:Toggleable\n 26.07%    6.981      1 Template:SmallIcon\n 15.79%    4.228      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 14.06%    3.764      1 Template:PageSeo\n 12.98%    3.476      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 12.77%    3.420      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n  9.53%    2.552      3 Template:IfEmpty\n  9.12%    2.441      1 Template:Passive_creatures_list\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:20599-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714203156 and revis